# Repository Structure Guide

This monorepo contains a backend (Node/TypeScript + Prisma) and a frontend (React + TypeScript).

## Entrypoints
- Backend entry: [backend/src/index.ts](mdc:backend/src/index.ts)
- Frontend entry: [frontend/src/index.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/index.tsx)

## Backend Highlights
- Domain-driven layering under `backend/src`:
  - Entities: [backend/src/domain/entities](mdc:backend/src/domain/entities)
  - Value Objects: [backend/src/domain/value-objects](mdc:backend/src/domain/value-objects)
  - Repositories: [backend/src/domain/repositories](mdc:backend/src/domain/repositories)
  - Use Cases: [backend/src/application/use-cases](mdc:backend/src/application/use-cases)
  - DTOs: [backend/src/application/dtos](mdc:backend/src/application/dtos)
  - Controllers/Routes: [backend/src/presentation](mdc:backend/src/presentation)
  - Infrastructure (Prisma): [backend/src/infrastructure](mdc:backend/src/infrastructure)
- Database schema: [backend/prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:backend/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Migrations: [backend/prisma/migrations](mdc:backend/prisma/migrations)
- Tests: [backend/src/tests](mdc:backend/src/tests) and compiled JS in [backend/dist/tests](mdc:backend/dist/tests)

## Frontend Highlights
- React app with components in [frontend/src/components](mdc:frontend/src/components)
- Hooks in [frontend/src/hooks](mdc:frontend/src/hooks)
- API service: [frontend/src/services/candidateApi.ts](mdc:frontend/src/services/candidateApi.ts)
- Types: [frontend/src/types](mdc:frontend/src/types)
- Styles: [frontend/src/styles](mdc:frontend/src/styles)
- Tests: [frontend/src/tests](mdc:frontend/src/tests)

## Documentation
- Project docs live under [docs](mdc:docs), including API specs, architecture, and task summaries.

## Conventions
- Keep backend feature logic in use-cases; controllers remain thin.
- Reuse DTOs between controller input/output and use-cases.
- Do not import infrastructure from domain/application layers.

